        "contextBefore": [],
        "contextAfter": [],
        "lastUpdatedLine": 176,
        "nonce": 0
      },
      "label": "processFile() — repair loop with deadline + per-anchor yield",
      "note": "Where actual work happens per file: iterates broken anchors, calls findRepairCandidate (may shell out to git history), applies repairs, then runs an inline deep-flex pass. Stops on the 3s deadline or disposal, and yields (setTimeout 0) between every anchor so a file with many broken anchors never monopolizes the CPU.",
      "createdAt": 1779287016923,
      "source": "mcp"
    },
    {
      "id": "NPwDepg4",
      "fileId": "cPqQBMDw",
      "groupId": "grM5t0mU",
      "target": {
