      "label": "Wiring: AnchorRepairQueue instantiated + deps injected here",
      "note": "Where the queue is constructed (line 717) and registered as a disposable (739). The RepairQueueDeps wired here connect the queue to the rest of the extension: getBrokenAnchors/getDeepFlexAnchors, findRepairCandidate (core), applyRepair, updateAnchorState, refreshUI, etc. Cancellation hooks are also wired nearby: markEdited (477), cancel on close (509), cancel on rename (571).",
      "createdAt": 1779287025888,
