      "label": "Separate throttle: debounced broken-anchors cache sync (1000ms)",
      "note": "A small standalone debounce (cacheSyncTimer, 1000ms) — NOT part of AnchorRepairQueue. Batches multiple repair/change events into a single syncBrokenAnchorsCache disk write so the cache isn't rewritten on every event. Example of the \"lots of little independent throttles\" pattern rather than one shared scheduler.",
      "createdAt": 1779287028980,
      "source": "mcp"
    },
