      "label": "Separate queue: OrderingService debounced + serialized disk writes",
      "note": "A DIFFERENT subsystem's queue. Manages drag-drop ordering state for bookmarks/files/groups. scheduleWrite() debounces disk writes by 250ms (DEBOUNCE_MS) and chains them through `inflight: Promise<void>` so writes serialize instead of racing. Work items = ordering-rank set/delete operations. Independent of the repair queue.",
      "createdAt": 1779287032028,
      "source": "mcp"
    },
