        "nonce": 0
      },
      "label": "Separate queue: sticky-anchor text-edit processing (per-doc debounce)",
      "note": "Another independent per-subsystem queue. registerStickyHandler tracks smart-anchor line positions as the user types. Buffers content-change events per document in `changeBuffers` and debounces processing per document via `pendingDocs` (Map<docUri, Timeout>). Work items = accumulated TextDocumentContentChangeEvents → updateAnchorForEdit / line-cache updates. Keeps rapid keystrokes from triggering anchor recomputation on every change.",
      "createdAt": 1779287036222,
      "source": "mcp"
    }
